{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23310","headline":"湖上醉中代诸妓寄严郎中 · 白居易","name":"湖上醉中代诸妓寄严郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笙歌杯酒正欢娱，忽忆仙郎望帝都。\n借问连宵直南省，何如尽日醉西湖。\n蛾眉别久心知否，鸡舌含多口厌无。\n还有些些惆怅事，春来山路见蘼芜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}